WEBVTT

01:23.420 --> 01:28.830
[A Splendid Match]

01:29.440 --> 01:31.850
[Episode 37]

01:37.590 --> 01:38.650
What are you doing?

01:52.360 --> 01:53.860
Chen Yanyun,

01:54.660 --> 01:56.610
you secretly hoard court secrets,

01:57.150 --> 01:58.950
which is tantamount to treason.

02:02.150 --> 02:03.590
Did you really think
you could find anything

02:03.590 --> 02:04.820
in the Ji residence?

02:05.710 --> 02:07.430
I've arranged for someone

02:08.560 --> 02:10.560
to deliver the files to His Majesty.

02:10.699 --> 02:12.490
Yet you willingly acted as a pawn,

02:12.490 --> 02:14.360
allowing Mentor to manipulate you.

02:14.360 --> 02:16.240
Now, you are but an abandoned piece,

02:16.240 --> 02:18.300
with your future completely ruined.

02:18.630 --> 02:19.970
According to the laws of Great Yan,

02:19.970 --> 02:21.500
if a son accuses his father,

02:21.800 --> 02:23.710
regardless of the father's crime,

02:23.710 --> 02:26.310
the son must receive
forty strokes of the cane.

02:26.560 --> 02:28.280
I just gave you forty lashes,

02:28.750 --> 02:29.630
not one more,

02:29.800 --> 02:30.590
not one less.

02:40.310 --> 02:41.150
Since you ordered someone

02:41.150 --> 02:42.950
to notify me to come to Tongzhou,

02:43.280 --> 02:45.010
I shall spare your life for now.

02:45.590 --> 02:48.000
I will have someone take you
out of the capital.

02:48.000 --> 02:49.000
From now on,

02:50.150 --> 02:52.210
we have nothing to do with each other.

03:02.560 --> 03:04.760
To think the nephew of a Grand Secretary

03:05.430 --> 03:07.800
is actually the son of a bandit.

03:07.610 --> 03:08.990
[Second, Chen Yanyun deceived the public by claiming]

03:09.020 --> 03:11.550
[that Chen Xuanqing was a son of a collateral branch of the Chen clan.]

03:10.840 --> 03:12.000
If one deceives the emperor,

03:12.000 --> 03:13.000
in lesser cases,

03:13.840 --> 03:15.030
one is stripped of their title.

03:15.030 --> 03:15.960
In severe cases,

03:16.560 --> 03:18.420
it means imprisonment and exile.

03:21.170 --> 03:22.210
Furthermore,

03:24.450 --> 03:26.110
there is the crime of murder.

03:54.120 --> 03:54.720
Xuanqing.

03:56.240 --> 03:57.070
Chen Yi,

03:57.150 --> 03:57.910
get a physician quickly!

03:57.910 --> 03:58.440
Yes, sir.

03:59.030 --> 04:00.160
How are you feeling?

04:01.120 --> 04:02.250
There's no need.

04:06.120 --> 04:07.020
Did you take poison?

04:07.020 --> 04:08.220
Spit it out, quickly!

04:08.300 --> 04:11.340
♪ Who, deep beneath the water ♪

04:12.360 --> 04:15.710
♪ Once shared the warmth of a palm ♪

04:15.000 --> 04:16.709
I never wanted you dead.

04:16.740 --> 04:17.800
Why did you have to do this?

04:16.990 --> 04:20.769
♪ Setting the gears of fate ♪

04:21.740 --> 04:24.700
♪ In motion ♪

04:25.070 --> 04:26.190
Third Uncle,

04:26.340 --> 04:29.130
♪ One curtain divides two worlds ♪

04:27.200 --> 04:29.140
I have always admired you.

04:30.320 --> 04:33.430
♪ Winter and spring
entrust their unspoken feelings ♪

04:35.040 --> 04:43.120
♪ Sparks dance in the air,
lighting up the night ♪

04:35.750 --> 04:37.210
Ever since I can remember,

04:39.950 --> 04:41.800
I imitated you in everything.

04:43.360 --> 04:45.510
I was always

04:46.159 --> 04:47.830
hesitant.

04:47.920 --> 04:49.620
I had feelings for her,

04:49.640 --> 04:52.300
but I was entirely focused on
becoming like you.

04:53.000 --> 04:53.560
I thought,

04:53.560 --> 04:54.510
that one day,

04:54.510 --> 04:57.040
I could own everything I wanted
just like you.

04:57.360 --> 04:59.070
Only in the end did I realize,

04:59.360 --> 05:01.310
I don't have even

05:01.310 --> 05:02.680
half your sober judgment.

05:02.680 --> 05:04.480
Now, my career,

05:04.480 --> 05:05.680
my love, my life...

05:05.870 --> 05:06.870
are all ruined.

05:07.630 --> 05:09.630
One wrong step led to another.

05:10.000 --> 05:12.310
You don't need to save me anymore.

05:15.360 --> 05:16.040
Xuanqing.

05:18.630 --> 05:19.310
Xuanqing!

05:37.420 --> 05:40.170
♪ An empty courtyard
awaits the falling snow ♪

05:41.460 --> 05:44.510
♪ Snow crowns the branches
like hair turned white with age ♪

05:46.040 --> 05:50.190
♪ Two families bound by a promise made ♪

05:50.920 --> 05:53.760
♪ And a newfound freedom gained ♪

05:55.230 --> 05:58.310
♪ No longer a lonely drifting boat ♪

05:59.300 --> 06:02.310
♪ We cross ten thousand mountains
in a sudden turn ♪

06:03.840 --> 06:12.030
♪ Through fierce storms
we honor our vow of life and death ♪

06:12.760 --> 06:16.120
♪ Lost together in a drunken dream ♪

06:16.980 --> 06:20.270
♪ The bright moon hangs high
leaving nowhere to hide ♪

06:21.880 --> 06:25.590
♪ Casting off our chains
to step into the swirl ♪

06:26.500 --> 06:29.970
♪ The dying flames of war
reflect within our eyes ♪

06:30.830 --> 06:33.630
♪ Even the howling wind
will come to rest ♪

06:35.020 --> 06:37.650
♪ Softly whispering how blessed I am
to have you ♪

06:38.400 --> 06:43.140
♪ This gentle clash of fire and water
bears witness ♪

06:43.720 --> 06:48.150
♪ As we sink into
the karma of this lifetime ♪

06:48.740 --> 06:49.670
Why are you here?

06:55.390 --> 06:56.830
I heard Yao say

06:57.390 --> 06:58.480
that Xuanqing...

07:02.310 --> 07:03.190
passed away.

07:04.360 --> 07:05.070
He came here with

07:05.070 --> 07:07.070
the absolute determination to die.

07:07.800 --> 07:09.530
He even had poison in his mouth.

07:10.190 --> 07:12.450
Fu Hailian used Yunting to threaten him.

07:13.930 --> 07:15.060
What about Yunting?

07:15.480 --> 07:16.610
He also passed away.

07:19.240 --> 07:20.300
Before I came here,

07:20.510 --> 07:21.560
the Shuntian Prefecture

07:21.560 --> 07:23.890
had already reported it to our residence.

07:23.950 --> 07:26.550
They said he accidentally
fell into the water.

07:27.070 --> 07:29.530
The first time I saw Xuanqing
nine years ago,

07:31.160 --> 07:32.190
he was

07:34.630 --> 07:35.830
small and frail,

07:35.950 --> 07:37.000
and of few words.

07:38.750 --> 07:39.830
Those eyes of his

07:40.600 --> 07:41.560
looked exactly like his father's,

07:41.560 --> 07:42.890
identical in every way.

08:13.120 --> 08:14.000
Mother

08:17.040 --> 08:18.840
wants to remove Xuanqing's name

08:18.920 --> 08:20.600
from the family genealogy.

08:22.310 --> 08:24.310
I want to hear your thoughts on this.

08:26.310 --> 08:27.430
You can

08:28.310 --> 08:29.390
make the decision.

08:40.789 --> 08:41.480
Alright.

08:54.440 --> 08:55.370
Prime Minister,

08:55.720 --> 08:56.240
just now, Chen Yanyun

08:56.240 --> 08:57.510
sent his man, Chen Yi, over.

08:57.510 --> 08:58.320
He said Lord Chen

08:58.320 --> 08:59.270
has a message for you.

08:59.270 --> 09:00.150
What message?

09:00.600 --> 09:01.790
Chen Xuanqing's plot failed,

09:01.790 --> 09:03.790
and he committed suicide by poison.

09:06.150 --> 09:07.080
Prime Minister,

09:07.510 --> 09:09.200
what do you think Chen Yanyun means

09:09.200 --> 09:10.550
by making such a move?

09:10.960 --> 09:11.820
Could it be that

09:12.120 --> 09:13.720
he is trying to threaten you?

09:14.600 --> 09:16.240
He is trying to tell me that

09:16.510 --> 09:18.080
he intends to pin all the blame

09:18.080 --> 09:19.550
entirely on me.

09:20.000 --> 09:20.750
How dare he!

09:21.790 --> 09:23.440
Why don't we find some imperial censor

09:23.440 --> 09:25.240
to make an issue out of this against him?

09:25.240 --> 09:25.870
After all,

09:26.240 --> 09:28.040
Chen Xuanqing died by his hands.

09:28.080 --> 09:29.000
Let it go.

09:30.270 --> 09:31.670
In order to go against me,

09:32.080 --> 09:33.510
he actually took the files

09:33.510 --> 09:34.910
that had been hidden

09:34.910 --> 09:36.910
in the file storeroom for ten years,

09:36.960 --> 09:39.160
and handed them all over to His Majesty.

09:41.320 --> 09:43.600
What a massive pledge of loyalty!

09:44.360 --> 09:46.760
He has finally bought His Majesty's favor.

09:47.240 --> 09:48.120
At a time like this,

09:48.120 --> 09:49.750
if I continue to relentlessly attack him,

09:49.750 --> 09:51.630
it would be crossing His Majesty.

09:52.630 --> 09:53.490
But His Majesty

09:53.720 --> 09:56.120
listens to everything you say, doesn't he?

09:59.080 --> 10:00.390
You shouldn't say

10:01.360 --> 10:03.090
any words like that from now on.

10:09.120 --> 10:10.670
Unless it is an absolute last resort,

10:10.670 --> 10:12.730
we must not fall out with His Majesty.

10:13.670 --> 10:15.070
I have spoken out of turn.

10:15.080 --> 10:16.790
You simply don't understand.

10:17.000 --> 10:19.150
His Majesty is getting on in years,

10:20.600 --> 10:22.360
and there are many people in the court

10:22.360 --> 10:25.220
who are hoping
he will take the reins of government.

10:33.860 --> 10:38.100
[Ji Mansion]

10:37.670 --> 10:39.270
Grandmother and I have discussed it.

10:38.240 --> 10:41.670
[Bound by Honesty]

10:39.790 --> 10:41.910
Except for Third Master and me,

10:42.270 --> 10:45.200
our whole family should
leave Tongzhou for a period,

10:45.440 --> 10:47.370
and move to Songjiang Prefecture.

10:48.000 --> 10:48.510
This...

10:49.150 --> 10:49.550
Wait,

10:50.510 --> 10:51.710
moving to Songjiang?

10:52.000 --> 10:53.000
Why go so far?

10:53.390 --> 10:54.440
Exactly.

10:54.750 --> 10:55.720
Although we do have

10:55.720 --> 10:57.120
some business dealings

10:56.470 --> 11:06.050
[Bound by Honesty]

10:57.120 --> 10:58.580
in Songjiang Prefecture,

10:58.600 --> 10:59.750
most of our businesses

10:59.750 --> 11:01.280
are all up here in the north.

11:01.720 --> 11:03.670
If we all move to Songjiang,

11:04.010 --> 11:05.270
our northern businesses

11:05.270 --> 11:06.600
will be left unattended.

11:06.600 --> 11:07.080
Mother,

11:07.670 --> 11:08.790
I can travel back and forth.

11:08.790 --> 11:09.320
You?

11:09.600 --> 11:11.200
You already knew about this?

11:11.510 --> 11:12.510
You brat,

11:12.510 --> 11:13.480
it's such a major matter.

11:13.480 --> 11:15.080
How could you not say a word about it?

11:15.080 --> 11:15.810
Alright now.

11:16.720 --> 11:17.440
Since

11:17.510 --> 11:19.480
Zhao and Third Master have said so,

11:19.550 --> 11:21.510
we just need to do as they say.

11:21.840 --> 11:23.960
It's all my fault

11:25.000 --> 11:26.100
to make all of you leave your home.

11:26.100 --> 11:32.760
[Bound by Honesty]

11:26.670 --> 11:27.530
Let me

11:30.480 --> 11:31.810
apologize to everyone.

11:32.320 --> 11:33.120
Third Master,

11:33.150 --> 11:35.030
please absolutely do not say that.

11:35.030 --> 11:36.240
It makes me feel ashamed

11:36.240 --> 11:38.790
if you say that.

11:39.030 --> 11:40.160
Please, have a seat.

11:44.870 --> 11:55.810
[Bound by Honesty]

11:48.200 --> 11:49.600
Not to mention that

11:50.240 --> 11:51.270
the Ji family

11:51.270 --> 11:53.330
has achieved its current prosperity

11:53.870 --> 11:56.440
entirely thanks to your care.

11:56.590 --> 11:58.630
Just speaking of moving to Songjiang,

11:58.630 --> 12:01.000
he is doing it for the good of us.

12:04.480 --> 12:05.720
Exactly, exactly.

12:06.390 --> 12:07.840
No need to apologize.

12:07.960 --> 12:09.250
We are all family.

12:10.960 --> 12:11.630
Aunt,

12:12.360 --> 12:13.000
Uncle,

12:14.120 --> 12:15.870
Third Master genuinely feels

12:15.870 --> 12:17.600
apologetic toward our family.

12:17.720 --> 12:18.870
Jinzhao is right.

12:19.270 --> 12:20.790
Ever since I placed those files

12:20.790 --> 12:22.120
in the Ji family's care,

12:22.550 --> 12:23.720
I had already

12:24.200 --> 12:25.360
put the entire Ji family

12:25.360 --> 12:26.670
over a roasting fire.

12:27.390 --> 12:29.390
And because of the grudge

12:29.390 --> 12:30.960
between the Senior Grand Secretary and me,

12:30.960 --> 12:33.150
the Ji family was almost
doomed beyond redemption.

12:33.150 --> 12:35.200
I'm still trembling with fear
at the thought.

12:35.200 --> 12:35.840
As things between me

12:35.840 --> 12:37.570
and the Senior Grand Secretary

12:37.670 --> 12:38.330
will likely

12:38.510 --> 12:40.030
get worse,

12:40.480 --> 12:41.840
I can only ask Old Madam

12:42.150 --> 12:45.150
to take the whole family
to Songjiang to take shelter.

12:47.000 --> 12:47.790
I don't want to go.

12:47.740 --> 12:49.630
[Bound by Honesty]

12:48.550 --> 12:50.080
Since the capital is dangerous,

12:50.080 --> 12:51.000
if Zhao is staying behind,

12:51.000 --> 12:52.000
I want to stay too.

12:52.750 --> 12:53.880
Stop being willful.

12:54.150 --> 12:55.010
Sit down first.

12:56.320 --> 12:57.790
Given the current situation,

12:57.790 --> 12:59.360
only if you all move to Songjiang

12:59.360 --> 13:01.090
can I feel a little more at ease.

13:02.150 --> 13:04.280
If you have already made the decision,

13:04.790 --> 13:06.250
why even ask the rest of us?

13:10.270 --> 13:11.320
Right now, do you want me to

13:11.320 --> 13:12.120
call you Lord Chen,

13:12.120 --> 13:13.250
or Brother-in-law?

13:13.510 --> 13:15.640
Then I shall call you Brother-in-law.

13:15.750 --> 13:16.960
Let me ask you this,

13:17.910 --> 13:19.750
If I want to take my sister
with me to Songjiang,

13:19.750 --> 13:20.680
would you agree?

13:20.870 --> 13:22.360
Why are you asking him?

13:22.670 --> 13:24.000
You should be asking me.

13:29.200 --> 13:30.270
I do not agree.

13:31.390 --> 13:33.000
Just ask your brother-in-law,

13:33.000 --> 13:35.130
whether he can bear to be apart from me.

13:35.270 --> 13:36.850
Right now, without me,

13:36.920 --> 13:38.050
he can't accomplish anything.

13:38.050 --> 13:40.340
[Bound by Honesty]

13:42.440 --> 13:44.300
I swear in front of everyone here,

13:44.720 --> 13:46.790
I will definitely
keep Jinzhao safe and sound.

13:46.790 --> 13:48.190
Should any mishap occur,

13:48.320 --> 13:49.440
I shall pay with my life.

13:49.440 --> 13:50.240
Third Master,

13:50.600 --> 13:52.130
there is no need to say that.

13:53.750 --> 13:54.510
Ji Feng.

13:54.210 --> 14:02.190
[Bound by Honesty]

13:54.870 --> 13:55.480
Old Madam.

13:56.030 --> 13:57.360
Go notify the servants

13:57.670 --> 13:59.360
to pack things immediately.

14:00.390 --> 14:01.050
Yes, ma'am.

14:02.910 --> 14:03.840
Why are you making it seem

14:03.840 --> 14:05.240
as if I'm the bad guy here?

14:07.550 --> 14:10.950
[Ji Mansion]

14:21.080 --> 14:23.630
Tell everyone to get ready to set off.

14:23.840 --> 14:24.320
Yes.

14:26.720 --> 14:27.480
Zhao,

14:27.600 --> 14:29.930
you and Third Master must be very careful.

14:33.060 --> 14:41.930
[Ji Mansion]

14:50.750 --> 14:52.320
Once I've escorted them safely to Jining,

14:52.320 --> 14:54.200
I will return to the capital to help you.

14:54.200 --> 14:54.870
Yao.

14:55.030 --> 14:56.220
I agreed to go to Songjiang

14:56.220 --> 14:57.950
to put my mother's mind at ease.

14:58.080 --> 14:59.740
You don't need to persuade me.

15:00.200 --> 15:01.000
Letting you be left all alone

15:01.000 --> 15:02.060
here in the capital

15:02.670 --> 15:04.400
is something I truly cannot do.

15:05.240 --> 15:06.720
I still have Third Master with me.

15:06.720 --> 15:07.600
It is exactly because of him

15:07.600 --> 15:09.130
that I am even more worried.

15:10.320 --> 15:11.480
There's no point in saying more.

15:11.480 --> 15:12.540
It's settled then.

15:17.040 --> 15:19.040
[Ji Mansion]

15:29.360 --> 15:30.160
What's wrong?

15:30.290 --> 15:31.410
Yao said

15:31.670 --> 15:33.400
he wants to stay here to help us.

15:44.240 --> 15:46.010
Chen Yanyun lacks moral integrity,

15:46.010 --> 15:47.270
his household is in turmoil,

15:47.270 --> 15:48.840
and he is unworthy of being a minister.

15:48.840 --> 15:51.480
He abuses power in the court,
leads a debauched life,

15:51.480 --> 15:53.360
and disregards justice and integrity.

15:53.360 --> 15:54.510
He colludes with merchants,

15:54.510 --> 15:57.120
forms factions for personal gain,
and deceives His Majesty.

15:57.120 --> 15:58.340
Your Majesty,

15:58.440 --> 16:01.240
please strictly investigate
his unlawful deeds.

16:04.390 --> 16:05.530
Third Master!

16:06.320 --> 16:07.320
Third Master!

16:39.480 --> 16:40.390
Chen Yanyun.

16:41.910 --> 16:43.510
Chen Yanyun, don't die.

16:47.270 --> 16:48.400
I won't die. I won't.

16:48.540 --> 16:49.340
I am here.

16:49.670 --> 16:51.000
I have always been here.

16:55.150 --> 16:56.480
Everything is fine now.

17:18.400 --> 17:19.880
Why did we come to Baoxiang Temple?

17:19.880 --> 17:20.680
You're awake.

17:21.200 --> 17:22.270
Put me down.

17:22.270 --> 17:23.400
I can walk on my own.

17:24.589 --> 17:25.440
Stop moving.

17:26.270 --> 17:27.599
I just want to carry you.

17:29.680 --> 17:30.960
But this is a temple.

17:32.510 --> 17:33.750
I think the Buddha

17:34.790 --> 17:36.720
is also pleased to see mortal love.

17:39.550 --> 17:40.200
Right.

17:40.310 --> 17:41.030
Jinzhao,

17:41.920 --> 17:44.050
you should smile like this more often.

17:46.590 --> 17:48.080
As long as we are both well,

17:48.440 --> 17:49.840
I will be happy every day.

17:52.550 --> 17:53.680
I'm sorry, Jinzhao.

17:56.720 --> 17:58.380
Why apologize all of a sudden?

18:01.200 --> 18:02.350
Seeing your family

18:03.750 --> 18:05.680
care for you in every possible way,

18:07.070 --> 18:07.920
what I've done doesn't even amount to

18:07.920 --> 18:09.270
a fraction of theirs.

18:10.590 --> 18:11.680
Before you married me,

18:11.680 --> 18:12.940
those concerns you had

18:13.310 --> 18:15.310
were indeed completely justified.

18:16.070 --> 18:16.910
Why?

18:17.270 --> 18:17.830
Do you want me to bring out

18:17.830 --> 18:19.680
the Letter of Amicable Separation,

18:19.680 --> 18:20.410
and let me go?

18:22.750 --> 18:23.640
That won't do.

18:24.790 --> 18:26.200
If I leave you,

18:27.070 --> 18:29.270
I won't be able to accomplish anything.

18:30.200 --> 18:31.530
Don't say that any more.

18:35.720 --> 18:36.440
Alright.

18:40.490 --> 18:42.110
If you could do it all over again,

18:42.110 --> 18:43.520
would you still marry me?

18:44.720 --> 18:46.450
I would marry you even earlier.

18:49.820 --> 18:53.520
[The Jade Realm of Enlightenment]

18:56.750 --> 18:57.410
We are here.

19:13.240 --> 19:14.000
Lord Chen,

19:14.020 --> 19:15.480
a noble guest has arrived.

19:21.000 --> 19:21.730
Understood.

19:24.880 --> 19:26.010
I will be right back.

19:42.830 --> 19:43.890
Don't catch a cold.

19:49.880 --> 19:51.400
This way, please.

19:58.050 --> 20:05.010
[Original Nature]

19:58.830 --> 20:01.550
Second Prince of Beiman murdered
his brother and usurped the throne.

20:01.550 --> 20:03.550
Rebel troops stormed
the Shicheng border market,

20:03.550 --> 20:05.590
injuring many citizens of Great Yan.

20:05.590 --> 20:06.720
Those urgent military reports

20:06.720 --> 20:07.790
sent back by express riders

20:07.790 --> 20:09.160
all express concern
that the border will fall into chaos,

20:09.160 --> 20:11.250
but Fu Hailian remains unruffled.

20:11.400 --> 20:12.000
For several days now,

20:12.000 --> 20:13.750
he hasn't proposed a single plan,

20:13.750 --> 20:17.060
even claiming
the situation is under control

20:17.240 --> 20:18.830
and that I need not worry.

20:19.720 --> 20:20.550
In my view,

20:20.880 --> 20:23.080
he has long been colluding with Beiman.

20:23.400 --> 20:26.270
His excuses of reducing
military expenditures

20:26.270 --> 20:27.870
and disbanding border troops

20:27.870 --> 20:30.030
are all meant
to cause chaos at the border,

20:30.030 --> 20:30.680
forcing me

20:30.790 --> 20:32.650
to rely heavily on him once again,

20:33.030 --> 20:35.480
so he can continue to hold great power.

20:36.000 --> 20:37.070
Your Majesty, your speculation

20:37.070 --> 20:38.270
is not without basis.

20:39.160 --> 20:39.720
However,

20:40.510 --> 20:41.920
we lack solid evidence.

20:42.350 --> 20:43.720
He has treated you this way,

20:43.720 --> 20:44.830
yet you still defend him?

20:44.830 --> 20:45.400
I

20:46.030 --> 20:47.560
am not defending my Mentor.

20:48.160 --> 20:48.960
It is just that

20:50.000 --> 20:52.030
he is the head
of all civil officials in Great Yan.

20:52.030 --> 20:53.680
Without conclusive evidence,

20:53.680 --> 20:54.640
convicting him

20:55.310 --> 20:57.240
would cause chaos at the very least,

20:57.240 --> 20:57.970
and at worst,

20:58.680 --> 21:01.080
it would shake
the foundation of the state.

21:01.350 --> 21:02.790
Then we shall investigate.

21:02.790 --> 21:03.480
I

21:04.310 --> 21:05.750
plan to dispatch an envoy

21:06.960 --> 21:09.110
under the pretext of congratulating
Second Prince on his ascension,

21:09.110 --> 21:11.110
to go to the border and investigate.

21:11.680 --> 21:12.790
What do you think?

21:15.270 --> 21:16.110
Your Majesty,

21:16.480 --> 21:17.880
this is a brilliant plan.

21:18.480 --> 21:19.640
Even my Mentor

21:19.790 --> 21:21.720
would not be able
to raise a single objection.

21:21.720 --> 21:22.750
However,

21:22.750 --> 21:25.150
selecting the right envoy has troubled me.

21:25.310 --> 21:26.880
Putting aside other matters,

21:26.880 --> 21:28.410
the people I can truly trust

21:28.590 --> 21:29.720
are indeed very few.

21:39.030 --> 21:39.830
Your Majesty,

21:40.310 --> 21:41.770
Lord Chen is not suitable.

21:42.790 --> 21:43.510
Why?

21:46.160 --> 21:47.270
Because I am going.

21:51.290 --> 21:52.080
You?

21:53.790 --> 21:55.450
You are not qualified enough.

21:55.880 --> 21:57.640
I'm the heir of the Marquis Changxing

21:57.640 --> 21:59.160
and Commander of the Xuanfeng Guards.

21:59.160 --> 22:00.960
Am I not more qualified than you?

22:01.440 --> 22:02.400
Don't forget,

22:02.590 --> 22:03.510
right now,

22:04.000 --> 22:06.060
you don't even hold an official post.

22:06.160 --> 22:08.310
It is precisely because
I hold no official post

22:08.310 --> 22:10.510
that His Majesty has a reason to send me.

22:10.960 --> 22:13.090
As for those who do hold official posts,

22:13.090 --> 22:14.290
they don't dare to go.

22:14.880 --> 22:16.140
And those who dare to go

22:17.000 --> 22:19.130
are incapable of getting things done.

22:22.730 --> 22:23.550
Your Majesty,

22:23.650 --> 22:25.660
I understand your intention.

22:25.830 --> 22:26.640
However,

22:27.030 --> 22:28.490
may I implore Your Majesty

22:28.790 --> 22:29.550
to allow me

22:30.000 --> 22:32.200
to return and discuss this with my wife?

22:32.240 --> 22:32.880
What?

22:33.310 --> 22:34.400
On matters of the state,

22:33.720 --> 22:35.910
[Original Nature]

22:34.790 --> 22:36.410
you cannot decide on your own?

22:36.410 --> 22:38.160
This is a great opportunity for you
to be reinstated.

22:38.160 --> 22:38.750
I

22:39.270 --> 22:40.880
can make my own decisions.

22:41.350 --> 22:42.030
But,

22:42.310 --> 22:43.770
previously because of me,

22:43.790 --> 22:46.520
the entire Ji family
almost suffered a disaster.

22:46.680 --> 22:47.340
I am already

22:47.830 --> 22:49.440
extremely sorry to Jinzhao.

22:50.030 --> 22:51.720
As for why the border
is in chaos this time,

22:51.720 --> 22:52.350
actually,

22:52.680 --> 22:55.030
Your Majesty and I both
have a clear answer in mind.

22:55.030 --> 22:56.560
If I go as an envoy to Beiman,

22:56.750 --> 22:58.440
it will surely be fraught with danger.

22:58.440 --> 22:59.110
I

22:59.830 --> 23:01.560
need to explain this to my wife.

23:03.110 --> 23:03.640
Alright.

23:04.070 --> 23:05.530
Then invite Gu Jinzhao in.

23:06.240 --> 23:07.640
You don't need to explain it either.

23:07.640 --> 23:09.240
I shall persuade her myself.

23:11.070 --> 23:12.130
Yes, Your Majesty.

23:18.440 --> 23:19.680
You begged His Majesty

23:19.680 --> 23:21.590
to ensure the Ji family's safety

23:21.590 --> 23:23.650
and not be implicated, which is fine,

23:24.440 --> 23:25.370
but you actually

23:25.640 --> 23:27.440
demanded those 300 matchlocks.

23:28.350 --> 23:29.200
Did you know

23:29.590 --> 23:31.310
in the entire court

23:31.720 --> 23:32.980
only the Armory Bureau

23:33.110 --> 23:35.160
has 300 new-style matchlocks?

23:35.640 --> 23:37.920
Marquis Jingyuan and Count Wuqing

23:37.920 --> 23:39.440
have been coveting them for a long time,

23:39.440 --> 23:40.750
but haven't managed to get a single one.

23:40.750 --> 23:41.640
That's why

23:42.030 --> 23:43.290
for matters like this,

23:43.310 --> 23:45.110
it is inappropriate
for you to bring it up.

23:45.110 --> 23:47.090
It only works if I bring it up

23:47.200 --> 23:49.440
because they'll think
I'm just being ignorant.

23:49.440 --> 23:51.250
You take these matchlocks

23:51.400 --> 23:52.930
and bring them all with you.

23:53.310 --> 23:54.070
Indeed.

23:54.550 --> 23:55.590
Thanks

23:56.830 --> 23:57.720
to you, my wife.

23:57.880 --> 24:00.070
Otherwise, I would have
suffered a loss again.

24:00.070 --> 24:01.280
Suffered a loss?

24:01.440 --> 24:02.590
You, suffer a loss?

24:03.000 --> 24:04.400
Don't think I don't know.

24:04.480 --> 24:06.480
You've been looking forward to going
for a long time.

24:06.480 --> 24:08.480
Those remnants of Chunyuan
are all over there.

24:08.480 --> 24:09.400
You are anxious to find evidence

24:09.400 --> 24:11.460
of Senior Grand Secretary's crimes.

24:16.200 --> 24:16.790
Yes.

24:18.590 --> 24:19.560
I do indeed

24:20.110 --> 24:22.370
want to find evidence against my Mentor.

24:22.480 --> 24:23.400
But actually,

24:24.680 --> 24:26.740
I hope even more that I won't find any.

24:32.070 --> 24:33.030
I know.

24:33.750 --> 24:35.080
Actually in your heart,

24:35.510 --> 24:37.030
you've always cherished

24:37.030 --> 24:38.510
the bond between you two.

24:39.720 --> 24:40.720
However,

24:41.510 --> 24:43.170
he never thought the same way.

24:46.400 --> 24:48.060
If you go as an envoy to Beiman,

24:48.790 --> 24:49.960
he will definitely set up

24:49.960 --> 24:51.510
an inescapable net over there

24:51.510 --> 24:52.440
waiting for you.

25:01.640 --> 25:03.640
Why don't you go back and pray again?

25:05.920 --> 25:07.180
For such a major event,

25:07.960 --> 25:09.560
I would rather believe in you

25:09.680 --> 25:10.440
and in me,

25:11.110 --> 25:12.770
and not in the gods or Buddhas.

25:22.450 --> 25:25.890
[Brushing Aside the Mist]

25:31.160 --> 25:32.220
I bid you farewell,

25:32.240 --> 25:33.350
my mentor.

25:34.070 --> 25:35.920
It is a long and perilous journey ahead.

25:35.920 --> 25:38.050
Be careful with everything, Jiuheng.

25:39.400 --> 25:40.510
After parting this time,

25:40.510 --> 25:42.200
I don't know when we will meet again.

25:42.200 --> 25:43.730
I have a question.

25:44.160 --> 25:45.360
Do you still remember

25:45.400 --> 25:47.000
after the metropolitan examination
that year,

25:47.000 --> 25:48.000
Fengming and I

25:48.240 --> 25:49.000
went to your residence

25:49.000 --> 25:50.130
to pay our respects?

25:53.350 --> 25:54.350
I do not remember.

25:54.680 --> 25:55.410
Fair enough.

25:55.880 --> 25:58.080
That day, you were not at the residence.

25:58.640 --> 25:59.830
But Fengming and I

26:00.750 --> 26:01.950
were unaware of this.

26:02.070 --> 26:03.470
After having breakfast,

26:03.480 --> 26:04.940
we went to your residence.

26:05.030 --> 26:06.690
We waited for a full six hours,

26:06.960 --> 26:08.640
and then we were led to the side hall.

26:08.640 --> 26:10.790
We waited until the very end
but never saw you,

26:10.790 --> 26:13.320
and instead were assigned
an essay question.

26:16.920 --> 26:19.050
I seem to recall something about that.

26:20.240 --> 26:22.640
But after I finished
answering the question

26:22.640 --> 26:23.700
and returned home,

26:23.790 --> 26:25.790
the moon was already high in the sky.

26:25.920 --> 26:27.650
I slept for less than four hours

26:27.920 --> 26:29.640
before my mother woke me up again.

26:29.640 --> 26:30.270
She said

26:30.270 --> 26:32.310
your residence had sent an invitation,

26:32.310 --> 26:33.680
ordering me to visit again
early in the morning.

26:33.680 --> 26:35.740
To this day, I still faintly remember

26:36.110 --> 26:37.440
the first time I saw you,

26:37.510 --> 26:38.770
and what you said to me.

26:38.790 --> 26:39.350
You said,

26:39.680 --> 26:40.590
Chen Yanyun,

26:41.960 --> 26:42.960
you were supposed

26:43.400 --> 26:44.800
to fail the examination.

26:50.310 --> 26:52.000
Did I say that?

26:52.580 --> 26:53.550
You also said

26:53.720 --> 26:54.960
the reason why you

26:55.240 --> 26:56.030
failed me

26:56.930 --> 26:58.790
was precisely because
during the metropolitan examination,

26:58.790 --> 27:00.070
the essay I wrote

27:00.870 --> 27:02.260
was too spot-on.

27:02.920 --> 27:03.830
Not too good,

27:04.240 --> 27:05.170
but too spot-on.

27:07.440 --> 27:08.240
At that time,

27:09.240 --> 27:11.750
your mind was entirely set on
pushing the new laws.

27:11.750 --> 27:14.080
However, there weren't many supporters.

27:14.480 --> 27:16.410
And the content of the essay I wrote

27:16.920 --> 27:18.240
was exactly what you had in mind,

27:18.240 --> 27:19.510
identical in every way,

27:19.510 --> 27:20.860
so you felt that

27:21.200 --> 27:22.130
a person like me,

27:22.750 --> 27:24.480
if not unnaturally intelligent,

27:24.480 --> 27:25.610
must be excessively

27:25.950 --> 27:27.830
skilled at fathoming others' minds.

27:27.830 --> 27:29.630
And towards this kind of people,

27:29.790 --> 27:31.520
you had always held a distaste.

27:33.110 --> 27:34.240
Even up to this day,

27:35.240 --> 27:36.640
I still hold a distaste.

27:39.880 --> 27:42.130
Then, do you remember

27:42.310 --> 27:43.920
the specific essay question

27:44.240 --> 27:45.270
you set for me?

27:47.160 --> 27:48.610
That question was about

27:48.680 --> 27:50.280
the rise and fall of reforms,

27:50.640 --> 27:52.830
and the gains and losses
of the new policies.

27:52.830 --> 27:54.960
I wrote a full five pages for the answer.

27:54.960 --> 27:56.420
But in the end, you told me,

27:56.480 --> 27:58.590
the essay can actually

27:59.310 --> 28:01.030
be summed up to one sentence.

28:02.440 --> 28:03.720
Weigh no personal cost

28:04.640 --> 28:06.100
for the people's welfare.

28:09.110 --> 28:10.310
From that day onward,

28:11.590 --> 28:12.400
these words

28:12.400 --> 28:13.510
have been etched into my mind

28:13.510 --> 28:14.970
and imprinted in my heart.

28:18.550 --> 28:20.480
What exactly are you trying to say?

28:23.310 --> 28:24.000
Mentor,

28:26.270 --> 28:27.880
Fengming is already dead.

28:31.400 --> 28:32.440
Back then, we

28:34.510 --> 28:35.960
were willing to die

28:35.960 --> 28:37.960
for new policies,

28:39.310 --> 28:41.110
for the land reform, and for you.

28:43.350 --> 28:44.550
But what about now?

28:49.720 --> 28:50.510
Everything has turned into

28:50.510 --> 28:51.790
what it is today.

29:51.750 --> 29:52.680
In the past,

29:53.830 --> 29:55.230
I received your guidance

29:56.000 --> 29:57.920
and benefited greatly from your teaching.

29:57.920 --> 29:59.310
I am deeply grateful

29:59.310 --> 30:01.110
and could never fully repay you.

30:02.270 --> 30:03.600
I only wish for my Mentor

30:05.310 --> 30:08.570
to remain true to your
original aspirations until the end.

31:50.200 --> 31:51.730
He's already gone far away.

31:51.790 --> 31:52.990
Why don't you go back?

31:57.750 --> 31:58.880
I just

31:59.680 --> 32:01.210
want to be alone for a while.

32:07.680 --> 32:09.310
You don't need to worry about him.

32:09.310 --> 32:10.770
On this journey to Beiman,

32:10.960 --> 32:11.880
he knew Fu Hailian

32:11.880 --> 32:13.590
would inevitably move against him.

32:13.590 --> 32:15.110
So, in front of all officials,

32:15.110 --> 32:16.910
he openly severed ties with him.

32:17.640 --> 32:19.700
This way, once he reaches the border,

32:19.750 --> 32:20.510
if Fu Hailian tries

32:20.510 --> 32:22.400
to play tricks on the envoy delegation,

32:22.400 --> 32:25.460
he would be suspected
of acting out of personal grudge.

32:25.640 --> 32:26.660
Your husband

32:26.830 --> 32:28.160
is deeply calculating.

32:28.590 --> 32:30.250
He won't be at a disadvantage.

32:35.070 --> 32:35.880
Thank you.

32:36.720 --> 32:38.320
What are you thanking me for?

32:39.270 --> 32:40.870
Thank you for comforting me.

32:42.270 --> 32:43.530
Who's comforting you?

32:53.840 --> 33:00.840
[The Heart as a Polished Mirror]

33:14.880 --> 33:15.880
You may all leave.

33:36.070 --> 33:37.170
I heard that

33:37.550 --> 33:39.750
before the envoy delegation departed,

33:39.750 --> 33:41.880
Chen Yanyun publicly reprimanded you

33:42.590 --> 33:44.720
and cut his robe to sever ties with you.

33:47.880 --> 33:50.550
He did it on purpose.

33:54.960 --> 33:56.720
That is indeed a clever move.

33:59.720 --> 34:01.030
But so what?

34:01.590 --> 34:03.950
No matter how many schemes he plays,

34:04.550 --> 34:06.710
it's a one‑way trip for him.

34:09.760 --> 34:11.159
Is everything arranged?

34:17.800 --> 34:18.590
Good.

34:22.070 --> 34:23.110
Excellent.

34:25.440 --> 34:27.280
If I hadn't been afraid
that he would follow the clues

34:27.280 --> 34:29.550
and uncover the Chunyuan Sect back then,

34:29.550 --> 34:30.590
why would I

34:31.630 --> 34:33.880
insist on putting him to death?

34:35.110 --> 34:36.030
What a pity!

34:42.360 --> 34:44.159
Actually, I really did consider

34:45.670 --> 34:47.600
letting him take over my position.

34:53.190 --> 34:54.840
What a pity!

34:56.850 --> 34:59.270
[The Heart as a Polished Mirror]

35:01.500 --> 35:04.800
[One Month Later]

35:05.260 --> 35:07.030
I'm going to the Western Hills tomorrow.

35:07.030 --> 35:08.400
No one will be here to take care of Baopu,

35:08.400 --> 35:09.800
so I'm leaving him to you.

35:10.110 --> 35:10.800
Alright.

35:11.920 --> 35:12.760
I didn't expect

35:12.760 --> 35:14.360
you to have grown this fat.

35:18.440 --> 35:19.070
Thank you.

35:21.030 --> 35:22.150
Thank me for what?

35:23.440 --> 35:24.300
I need to return

35:24.440 --> 35:25.900
to the government office.

35:36.440 --> 35:37.000
Hey!

35:37.360 --> 35:38.510
Didn't we agree

35:42.230 --> 35:44.710
that you'd stay with Gu Jinzhao
for a few days?

35:44.710 --> 35:46.170
You're backing out again.

35:48.400 --> 35:49.360
I was

35:49.360 --> 35:50.880
taking care of you all along.

35:50.880 --> 35:52.800
And I raised you for so long,

35:53.630 --> 35:55.360
and you've only been
with Ye Xian for a few days.

35:55.360 --> 35:56.890
How did you end up like this?

35:57.070 --> 35:58.870
What an ungrateful bad cat!

35:59.400 --> 35:59.920
Hey!

36:00.280 --> 36:01.410
What are you saying?

36:01.590 --> 36:03.520
How can you say such things to a cat?

36:07.110 --> 36:07.710
Madam.

36:11.630 --> 36:12.430
Commander Ye.

36:14.280 --> 36:16.080
We just received a secret report

36:16.150 --> 36:19.030
that the envoy delegation was attacked
in Shicheng.

36:19.030 --> 36:21.110
Only two of them returned to the capital.

36:21.110 --> 36:22.070
Overnight,

36:22.880 --> 36:24.740
all of the rest have gone missing.

36:27.320 --> 36:27.960
Then...

36:29.110 --> 36:30.030
what about him?

36:31.190 --> 36:32.320
Third Master...

36:35.000 --> 36:36.930
his whereabouts are also unknown.

36:41.280 --> 36:41.940
Gu Jinzhao.

36:47.070 --> 36:47.760
It's fine.

36:50.000 --> 36:51.600
I see it coming.

36:55.880 --> 36:56.510
Do you still remember

36:56.510 --> 36:57.970
the names of those two men?

36:58.230 --> 36:58.920
I remember.

36:59.590 --> 37:00.880
They are from Censorate,

37:00.880 --> 37:02.810
called Lin Ruhui and Zhou Chudong.

37:04.510 --> 37:06.070
I remember them.

37:07.400 --> 37:09.130
They are both Fu Hailian's men.

37:10.960 --> 37:12.110
So,

37:12.590 --> 37:14.150
Fu Hailian's next step

37:15.030 --> 37:17.690
is to make a move against
the entire Chen family.

37:19.150 --> 37:20.320
Logically speaking,

37:20.320 --> 37:21.720
with the envoy attacked,

37:22.070 --> 37:24.070
Third Master has likely been murdered.

37:24.070 --> 37:25.360
But if Fu Hailian

37:25.360 --> 37:27.020
wants to harm the Chen family,

37:27.190 --> 37:29.520
he would have to
pin the cause of the attack

37:29.710 --> 37:31.710
on Third Master.

37:40.070 --> 37:41.150
I understand.

37:50.440 --> 37:51.840
I want to see His Majesty.

37:53.070 --> 37:53.590
Okay.

37:54.070 --> 37:55.070
I will arrange it.

37:57.280 --> 37:58.960
The weather is dry,

37:59.110 --> 38:01.030
beware of fire!

38:01.260 --> 38:03.040
The weather is dry,

38:01.940 --> 38:05.050
[Virtue Through the Ages]

38:03.190 --> 38:05.110
beware of fire!

38:05.320 --> 38:06.710
Even if you hadn't come to find me,

38:06.710 --> 38:08.570
I would have come looking for you.

38:08.920 --> 38:09.920
Two imperial censors

38:09.920 --> 38:11.680
managed to escape
and return from Shicheng.

38:11.680 --> 38:13.440
They brought back a letter
that the Second Prince of Beiman

38:13.440 --> 38:14.670
wrote to Chen,

38:15.360 --> 38:17.480
proving that it was Chen
who colluded with them

38:17.480 --> 38:19.280
to attack the envoy delegation.

38:19.920 --> 38:21.520
The consensus in the court is

38:21.710 --> 38:24.280
to throw the entire Chen family
into prison for investigation.

38:24.280 --> 38:25.080
Your Majesty,

38:25.440 --> 38:27.000
Jiuheng is innocent.

38:28.800 --> 38:30.000
Of course I know that.

38:30.760 --> 38:32.560
My secret agents sent back word,

38:32.960 --> 38:33.620
saying that

38:34.110 --> 38:35.840
after the envoy delegation was attacked,

38:35.840 --> 38:37.840
there was an opportunity to escape.

38:39.230 --> 38:39.800
Liang,

38:40.360 --> 38:42.480
I plan to entrust the delegation to you.

38:42.480 --> 38:44.230
Shicheng is surrounded by mountains.

38:44.230 --> 38:45.230
After you escape,

38:45.320 --> 38:46.450
find a place to hide.

38:46.670 --> 38:47.760
Let both the court and Beiman think

38:47.760 --> 38:49.880
that the delegation has been wiped out.

38:49.880 --> 38:50.510
Only in this way

38:50.510 --> 38:52.150
can the danger be reduced to a minimum.

38:52.150 --> 38:52.670
Chen Yi,

38:52.920 --> 38:53.510
you stay behind

38:53.510 --> 38:54.800
and protect Lord Liang.

38:54.800 --> 38:56.030
Yes, Third Master.

38:57.070 --> 38:57.960
But after that,

38:58.510 --> 38:59.970
there was no further news.

39:01.710 --> 39:02.800
No news

39:03.400 --> 39:04.730
is better than bad news.

39:07.280 --> 39:08.630
Thank you, Your Majesty,

39:08.630 --> 39:10.030
for telling me this.

39:10.920 --> 39:11.800
Right now,

39:12.550 --> 39:13.630
the letter

39:13.710 --> 39:14.840
from the Second Prince

39:14.840 --> 39:16.570
is the most troublesome issue.

39:17.070 --> 39:18.870
Chen is completely out of touch,

39:18.960 --> 39:21.290
leaving no room for him to defend himself.

39:21.510 --> 39:22.310
Your Majesty,

39:22.510 --> 39:24.190
I actually have a method

39:24.510 --> 39:25.640
sufficient to prove

39:25.800 --> 39:28.130
that Jiuheng would never commit treason.

39:40.550 --> 39:41.630
This is...

39:41.960 --> 39:42.670
Last year,

39:42.840 --> 39:45.000
Jiuheng once told me

39:44.260 --> 39:48.420
[Battalion of One Hundred Small Breech-Loading Cannons]

39:45.800 --> 39:48.880
that Your Majesty had ordered
the Armory Bureau to manufacture cannons.

39:48.880 --> 39:51.210
Unfortunately, they met with no success.

39:51.490 --> 39:52.400
So he asked me

39:52.510 --> 39:54.840
to send someone to Haojing
to purchase them.

39:54.840 --> 39:56.280
Before Jiuheng departed as an envoy,

39:56.280 --> 39:57.920
Your Majesty bestowed upon me

39:57.920 --> 39:59.000
300 matchlocks.

39:59.480 --> 40:00.230
Now,

40:00.960 --> 40:02.590
I am willing to offer all these

40:02.590 --> 40:04.050
in return to Your Majesty.

40:13.360 --> 40:15.880
In total, 100 small
breech-loading cannons,

40:15.880 --> 40:17.810
50 large breech-loading cannons,

40:18.110 --> 40:20.070
plus 10 heavy siege cannons,

40:20.630 --> 40:22.760
as well as 10 cannon‑making artisans.

40:23.190 --> 40:25.760
These are all things that

40:25.840 --> 40:27.590
Chen ordered people
to purchase from Haojing

40:27.590 --> 40:29.230
in the first half of the year
to present to me.

40:29.230 --> 40:30.510
If Chen was truly colluding

40:30.510 --> 40:31.780
with Beiman,

40:32.280 --> 40:34.710
why would he go through the trouble

40:34.840 --> 40:36.570
to present these cannons to me?

40:37.110 --> 40:38.110
Shouldn't he have bought them

40:38.110 --> 40:40.370
for the Second Prince of Beiman instead?

40:44.800 --> 40:50.870
[The Emperor Establishes Supreme Order]

40:45.840 --> 40:46.670
I believe

40:46.760 --> 40:48.190
the ones to be strictly investigated
shouldn't be

40:48.190 --> 40:50.520
the women and children of the Chen family,

40:50.630 --> 40:52.880
but rather those two imperial censors

40:52.960 --> 40:54.390
who managed to escape and return

40:54.390 --> 40:55.510
when the entire delegation

40:55.510 --> 40:56.760
is missing.

41:03.460 --> 41:06.890
[A Heart of Purity and Loftiness]

41:06.120 --> 41:06.960
Jinzhao,

41:07.320 --> 41:08.400
are you really going to the border

41:08.400 --> 41:09.460
to look for Yanyun?

41:11.320 --> 41:12.720
The court is unreliable.

41:13.920 --> 41:14.630
Moreover,

41:15.070 --> 41:15.920
I've already sent Qingpu

41:15.920 --> 41:17.120
out there for so long,

41:17.590 --> 41:19.390
and still there is no news at all.

41:19.550 --> 41:21.010
If I don't go there myself,

41:21.070 --> 41:22.400
my mind won't be at ease.

41:24.820 --> 41:26.020
Don't worry about me.

41:27.190 --> 41:28.590
In Pingyang Prefecture,

41:28.670 --> 41:29.670
I have businesses

41:29.760 --> 41:30.590
and manpower.

41:31.630 --> 41:32.590
I will be fine.

41:33.840 --> 41:35.550
Then you must be very careful.

41:41.840 --> 41:43.230
After Mother heard the news,

41:43.230 --> 41:44.560
she has been bedridden.

41:44.630 --> 41:45.800
Just now she insisted on coming over,

41:45.800 --> 41:47.930
and I had a hard time keeping her in bed.

41:50.400 --> 41:51.230
Are you two

41:52.280 --> 41:53.400
really going?

41:58.000 --> 41:58.670
Xianlan,

41:59.150 --> 42:00.960
these are the ritual lands Third Master

42:00.960 --> 42:02.620
has purchased over the years.

42:02.840 --> 42:05.480
No matter what happens
to the Chen family in the future,

42:05.480 --> 42:07.210
as long as these lands are here,

42:07.480 --> 42:09.110
they will ensure the Chen family

42:09.110 --> 42:11.040
never lacks for food and clothing.

42:20.480 --> 42:21.280
I understand.

42:22.280 --> 42:23.230
But it's agreed,

42:24.480 --> 42:26.880
I am only temporarily
keeping them for you.

42:27.320 --> 42:28.340
When you return,

42:28.440 --> 42:29.900
I'll give them back to you.

42:31.400 --> 42:32.450
On your journey,

42:32.590 --> 42:34.050
you must be extra careful.

42:34.150 --> 42:34.880
Understand?

42:35.070 --> 42:35.760
I know.

42:37.000 --> 42:38.130
Thank you, Xianlan.

42:40.360 --> 42:42.090
You want to find Third Brother,

42:42.480 --> 42:44.940
but you must also
take good care of yourself.

42:44.960 --> 42:45.840
You too.

42:46.590 --> 42:47.920
Take good care of yourself,

42:47.920 --> 42:48.840
and Mother.

42:50.190 --> 42:52.250
I won't go formally bid her farewell.

42:52.880 --> 42:53.590
Okay.

42:54.670 --> 42:55.480
Zhao,

42:57.710 --> 42:58.920
you must stay safe.

43:01.030 --> 43:01.630
Take care.

43:43.230 --> 43:46.820
[A Splendid Match]
